<title>USA: Metro Pier, Ill., to sell $510 mln deal Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Metro Pier, Ill., to sell $510 mln deal Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Monday it plans to price $510 million Metropolitan Pier and Exposition Authority, Ill., expansion project refunding bonds on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal has been on the day-to-day calendar, meaning underwriters were waiting for interest rates to fall before bringing the issue.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
